---
description: When to use PlugLayer tools instead of the browser
alwaysApply: true
---

Use PlugLayer tools, not the browser, when the user mentions PlugLayer, pluglayer.com, their projects, apps, deploys, domains, databases, logs, compute, or account.

- Projects: `list_projects`
- Apps in one project: `get_apps_by_project`
- All apps: `list_deployments`
- Signed-in user: `get_current_user`
- Wait for a task: `get_task_status`

Run setup only to install, update, or reconnect. Open deploy, domain, fix-deploy, security, template, CI, or feedback skills only for that task. Leave unrelated repo work to the normal agent. Confirm before delete or rollback. No admin tools.
